# `@shuttering/tokens` is a private package on GitHub Packages. Scope mapping is
# all-or-nothing — npm has no per-package registry key — so this points the whole
# scope at GitHub Packages. `@shuttering/starlight` itself publishes to both
# registries precisely so that mapping resolves it too.
#
# No credential here. Locally the token comes from ~/.npmrc; in CI from the
# NODE_AUTH_TOKEN that actions/setup-node writes.
@shuttering:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
